{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"barn","model_identifier":"barn","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# barn\n\nBarn (Patch 5 model; the Barn was a tinted pen_barn before): a classic red barn with white trim and a gambrel roof of weathered grey shingles. White X-braced sliding doors on an iron track, an open hay loft with a hoist beam, pulley and rope, a cupola with a cockerel weathervane and a player-colour pennant, and small lit windows. A white post-and-rail paddock in front and along the left (-X) side holds a feed trough, a water trough, hay bales, a milk churn, a bucket and trampled earth, with open floor for the grazing animals and the barn worker. Hay stack and a manure barrow at the back left.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 10 columns (160 x 160 units, 4.50 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z. The barn itself stands to the right and back (x -22..74, z -24..76); the paddock fills the front and left.\n- Finished bounds: x -78..79, y 0..156 (ridge 112, weathervane 156), z -78..80 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 236, construction_0 85, construction_33 145, construction_66 197, ruined 249 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n- Glowing parts: 5 lit windows `glow_window_*` (lit at night while the barn is worked).\n- Team colour (52, 96, 178): the weathervane pennant.\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `barn_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- barn: 96 x 112 x 100 centred at x 26, z 26\n- paddock fence: walk-through for the barn's animals and its worker\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (26, 0, -34)\n- `slot_worker` at (4, 0, -50): where the barn worker stands tending the animals by day.\n- `slot_yard_1` to `slot_yard_6` at (-58, 0, -50), (-34, 0, -46), (-8, 0, -62), (48, 0, -48), (-52, 0, -6), (-44, 0, 20): grazing spots in the paddock.\n- `fx_window_1` to `fx_window_5` at (-25, 36, 4), (-25, 36, 48), (76.7, 36, 4), (76.7, 36, 48), (26, 76, 78.5): the lit windows."},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"planks_v_wall_west#9b2f25","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-22,-0.3,-24],"to":[-18,64,76],"autouv":0,"color":3,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[180,114,184,178],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[372,0,472,64],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[184,114,188,178],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[472,0,572,64],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[356,0,360,100],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[360,0,364,100],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"89563fd1-cd4c-0eaf-a593-7839788b29f1"},{"name":"planks_v_wall_east#9b2f25","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[70,-0.35,-24],"to":[74,64,76],"autouv":0,"color":6,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[188,114,192,178],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[572,0,672,64],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[192,114,196,178],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[672,0,772,64],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[364,0,368,100],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[368,0,372,100],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c7d52115-79c9-29c7-122d-2db49a068280"},{"name":"planks_v_wall_front#9b2f25","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirro